        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 7:48PM PDT until September 26 at 3:00AM PDT by NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Hazardous sea conditions.

* WHERE...Point Piedras Blancas to Point Sal westward out to 10
NM.

* WHEN...Until 3 AM PDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...See the Coastal Waters Forecast (CWFLOX)
for more.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
